{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2>Bor Dungeon is a fast paced action RPG mixing with platformer and simple puzzles. Smashing your way through dark dungeons defeating hordes of enemies and collecting loot, become the ultimate Bor!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388900/extras/d66e1f539274a06ddd79489a65ff15c9.poster.avif?t=1692109461\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388900/extras/d66e1f539274a06ddd79489a65ff15c9.webm?t=1692109461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388900/extras/d66e1f539274a06ddd79489a65ff15c9.mp4?t=1692109461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Play as third person Bor, collecting loot, gain unique skills and smashing huge Bosses!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2>\u25aa\ufe0fAction packed with physics: the game has interactive environment. You can jump on, smash, and examine anything in the level as your physics playground! <br>\u25aa\ufe0fSmooth and responsive movement and combat<br>\u25aa\ufe0fCutesy design in enemies and environment<br>\u25aa\ufe0fDefeat big bosses to gain additional skills and unleash your full potential!<br>\u25aa\ufe0fNo loot boxes, microtransactions or ANY additional purchases required- all content is available to unlock in game by playing.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fEach weapon type comes with different skill set.<br>\u25aa\ufe0fChallenging bosses with engaging combat!<br>Solo developed by Spikebor<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SMACK THINGS WITH YOUR HAMMER</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388900/extras/da496efbefee1a9da28e1a022d042339.poster.avif?t=1692109461\" width=600 height=338 ><source src